# Learnosity custom question type bundles.
# Built by packages/integrations/learnosity (webpack) straight into public/ on every
# `npm run build`, and copied on to dist/ by vite's publicDir. Not byte-reproducible --
# Terser's parallel workers vary variable hoisting -- so committing them churns for nothing.
